// The B12 boss arena (WP-080, BossArena-v0): the roof of the Lattice Spire and the Unspooled.
// docs/game/05-enemies-and-bosses.md, "B12 The Unspooled". The scenario keeps the level's x and z
// (game/data/levels/spire/layout.ron: a roof about 36 m across, a low rim, four loom pillars, and
// the stair corridor from F3 ending in the fog gate) on a flat floor at y = 0 (the level's roof is
// at y = 22), so a position in one is the same position in the other.
//   - The player spawns in the corridor at (6.5, 0, -8) facing +Z, outside the fog gate.
//   - The fog gate is the plane z = -5.25 across the corridor's opening (x 5..8), opening north.
//   - The Unspooled stands at (0, 0, 8) facing -Z (toward the gate).
//   - The Echo Stone stands just inside the gate (phase 1 only; see the boss file).
//   - The roof is open on every side within the rim, so every corner has two ways out.
//   - The player carries two Great Sigils, as in the level (`spire/area.ron`), so phase 2 borrows
//     B06's and B07's moves.
(
  spawn: (6.5, 0.0, -8.0),
  spawn_yaw: 0.0,
  kill_y: -12.0,
  heightfield: None,
  boxes: [
    (name: "roof", center: (0.0, -0.5, 0.0), half_extents: (18.5, 0.5, 18.5)),
    (name: "corridor_floor", center: (0.0, -0.5, -7.5), half_extents: (10.0, 0.5, 2.5)),
